  "id": "Hackney-2023_1444",
  "description": "We are a family of 4, we do not own a car - but we all cycle and we want to place a safe, smart looking Bike and Bin store in our front garden.  The intention is to make something that is functional, safe and accessible as well as nice looking within the environment of the street. We currently store all of our bikes inside of the house which takes up unnecessary and much needed space, there is also a limited number of safe storage facilities provided by the council in our local area - by building our own we will rely less on the council to provide any sort of support in this regards.\n\nThere are several of these bike boxes in our local area, funded by individual households. See the attached document outlining them all, including their planning permissions.",
